{
  "name": "mcp-local-hub",
  "version": "0.4.37",
  "description": "mcp-local-hub (mcphub): a local supervisor + router that compresses duplicate MCP (Model Context Protocol) server processes across clients into one managed hub. The 0.4.37 npm release supports Windows x64; other platforms are deferred.",
